---

An algebraic datatype with multiple ${fref("programming-language-theory/concepts/type-variant.td")}s combined via "or" - a value is one of the variants, each with its own ${fref("programming-language-theory/concepts/constructor-tag.td")} (e.g., BT = mt | node).

An algebraic datatype with **multiple ${fref("programming-language-theory/concepts/type-variant.td")}**s combined via "or" - a value is **one of** the variants, each with its own **${fref("programming-language-theory/concepts/constructor-tag.td")}** (e.g., `BT = mt | node`).
